              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “And you, O son of man, thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to the land of Israel: An end! The end has come upon the four corners of the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the end is upon you, and I will let loose my anger upon you, and will judge you according to your ways; and I will punish you for all your abominations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my eye will not spare you, nor will I have pity; but I will punish you for your ways, while your abominations are in your midst. Then you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
